ask a4: wage * hrs with wage = 30, hrs = 2.5
ask a5: x, x + x with x = 12.5
ask a6: i + i with i = 7
ask a7: n with n = 0.25
ask a8: pct with pct = -(5)
ask a9: pct with pct = (-5)
ask a10: (pct + pct) as if {pct = 5}
ask a11: x with x = -1.5
version v
